  "description": "CR 510.2, 603.5, 712.11a, 712.11, 715.3a, 715.2b, 715.2c, 715.3c, 715.4, 701.9a, 701.21a, 702.111b: Jecht, Reluctant Guardian's combat-damage trigger is a may: declined, Jecht stays; exercised, Jecht is exiled and returns transformed as Braska's Final Aeon, a 7/7 creature Saga with menace entering with a lore counter. Chapters I and II make each opponent discard a card of their choice and its controller draw a card; chapter III makes each opponent sacrifice two creatures of their choice, and then the Saga is sacrificed",
  "note": "Three seats so each opponent is both bob and carol and never alice. Turn 1: bob's lone block of a menace attacker is refused; Jecht hits bob for 4 and alice declines, so Jecht stays. Turn 4: Jecht hits carol for 4 and alice exercises; Braska's Final Aeon arrives with one lore counter, bob and carol each choose one of three cards to discard, and alice draws Lava Axe. Turn 7: the second lore counter repeats it (alice draws Lightning Bolt). Turn 10: the third makes bob and carol each sacrifice two of their three creatures, alice's Gray Ogre untouched; with three lore counters and no chapter on the stack the Saga is sacrificed to alice's graveyard, and alice draws nothing more (Island stays on top).",
